title: Pear Butter
author: Patti Tucker
course: OMT! Eats
method: slow-cook
source: https://ohmrstucker.com/the-best-pear-butter-recipe-youll-ever-make/
cuisine: American
protein: none
servings: 4
cook time: 5 hours
prep time: 10 minutes
time required: 5 hours 10 minutes
alternative_name: Pear Butter Recipe
ingredient_count: 5
---

Place @ripe pears{10}(quartered and cut into large pieces, skin on), @dark brown sugar{1%cup}, @all spice{2%tsp} and @fresh ground nutmeg{1/4%tsp} into #slow cooker{} and mix.

Turn on high and cook for ~{4-5%hours}, until pear pieces are very soft.

Once cooked, cool enough to mix with #immersion blender{}, or pour into regular #blender{}.

Blend to desired texture.

Add @homemade vanilla{1-2%tsp} and @fresh-squeezed lemon juice{1%tbsp}.

Mix thoroughly.

Pour into #jars{} to store in fridge or freezer.